<h1>Sonya Marie Harper</h1>
<p>Illinois House, 6th District, on the Chicago ballot November 3, 2026. Party: Democratic. Incumbent.</p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>No campaign site found. Issue areas listed on her legislative office site include agriculture and cannabis, economic opportunity and equity, food access, public safety and violence reduction, education, health care and human services, people with records, and the environment; it highlights her work on cannabis social equity provisions and the Illinois Farmer Equity Act.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>Executive director of Grow Greater Englewood and president of Sharper PR Communications, a former television news producer, and a former outreach director at Growing Home Inc.; in the House since October 2015.</p>
